    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82510" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιφρουρ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>guard on all sides, blockade closely</i>, <i><span class="en">
